From: TaoXiaoBai <taoxiaobai@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lithium: optimize chunk palette serialization

Based on Lithium PR #709, commit d258ae5c3d61a052017934b33de7db8be2153d4e.
Original PR author: ishland <ishlandmc@yeah.net>
Original compaction implementation: JellySquid
Original project: https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium
Licensed under: LGPL-3.0-only

Reuse fixed-size per-thread buffers, compact packed palette indices directly,
avoid repacking unchanged Lithium palettes, and use dense counters for the
small palettes used by chunk sections.
